{"id":"efecto","lemma":"efecto","pos":"noun","rank":1174,"glosses":["effect"],"ipa":"/eˈfeɡto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"efectos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-efecto.wav","examples":[{"text":"El efecto fue inmediato.","en":"The effect was immediate.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"immediate"}]},{"text":"Los efectos son irreversibles.","en":"The effects are not reversible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645631","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"No hubo efectos secundarios.","en":"There were no side effects.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"secondary","l":"secundario"}]},{"text":"El remedio tuvo un efecto inmediato.","en":"The medicine had an immediate effect.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"remedy, solution"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"immediate"}]},{"text":"¿Qué efecto dijo el doctor que tenía esta medicina en la gente?","en":"What effect did the doctor say this medicine has on people?","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"doctor"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"medicine"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"people"}]}]}